{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">在無綫節目《在家宴客60道菜》中，Jacques Kagi 親自示範了一道經典的西式佳餚「牧羊人批」。這道菜式巧妙地將特製羊肉醬與綿滑薯蓉結合，並加入充滿風味的新疆香料粉，惹味非常，絕對是派對宴客的絕佳主菜！</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"51e52707-db1c-435d-b38d-bb18772dccb0.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026pPIuo1iIvp1791281263.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"51e52707-db1c-435d-b38d-bb18772dccb0.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>食材</strong></p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>肉類：</strong> 免治羊肉 1.5 公斤</p></li><li></li><li></li><li></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>做法</strong></p><ol class=\"tiptap-ordered-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li></ol><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"b9a62a3f-37ff-4339-829d-bf17aed7d6d4.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026HjTepMUCmU1791281262.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"b9a62a3f-37ff-4339-829d-bf17aed7d6d4.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>大廚貼士</strong></p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li></ul></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-07T01:19:47.456655+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":131,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}